    {
      "collection": "state-controllers",
      "name": "TargetFacing",
      "additions": [
        { "path": ["page", "engine"], "value": "mugen" },
        { "path": ["page", "introduced_in"], "value": null },
        { "path": ["documentation"], "value": { "description": "<p>ターゲットの向きを、実行者と同じ方向または反対方向へ変更します。<code>ID</code> で対象を絞り込めます。</p>", "evidence": { "status": "confirmed", "basis": ["official_document"], "source_refs": ["targetfacing-local-2002", "targetfacing-local-1.0", "targetfacing-local-1.1"] } } },
        { "path": ["parameter", 0, "expression_policy"], "value": "expression" },
        { "path": ["parameter", 0, "default"], "value": [{ "kind": "literal", "value": -1, "display": "すべてのターゲット", "evidence": { "status": "confirmed", "basis": ["official_document"], "source_refs": ["targetfacing-local-2002", "targetfacing-local-1.0", "targetfacing-local-1.1"] } }] },
        { "path": ["parameter", 0, "documentation"], "value": { "description": "<p>向きを変えるターゲット ID を整数式で指定します。一致する ID のターゲットだけが対象です。省略時は <code>-1</code> で、すべてのターゲットを対象にします。</p>", "evidence": { "status": "confirmed", "basis": ["official_document"], "source_refs": ["targetfacing-local-2002", "targetfacing-local-1.0", "targetfacing-local-1.1"] } } },
        { "path": ["parameter", 0, "load_priority_evidence"], "value": { "status": "confirmed", "basis": ["maintainer_report"], "comment": "既存の読み込み順は基本的に検証済みとの管理者確認（2026-09-07）。検証ビルド等の詳細は未記録。" } },
        { "path": ["parameter", 1, "expression_policy"], "value": "expression" },
        { "path": ["parameter", 1, "default"], "value": [{ "kind": "required", "display": "実行者を基準とする向きを指定", "evidence": { "status": "confirmed", "basis": ["official_document"], "source_refs": ["targetfacing-local-2002", "targetfacing-local-1.0", "targetfacing-local-1.1"] } }] },
        { "path": ["parameter", 1, "documentation"], "value": { "description": "<p>正数なら実行者と同じ方向、負数なら実行者と反対方向を向かせます。省略できません。</p>", "hide_legacy": ["default_value"], "evidence": { "status": "confirmed", "basis": ["official_document"], "source_refs": ["targetfacing-local-2002", "targetfacing-local-1.0", "targetfacing-local-1.1"] } } },
        { "path": ["evidence"], "value": { "status": "confirmed", "basis": ["official_document"], "source_refs": ["targetfacing-local-2002", "targetfacing-local-1.0", "targetfacing-local-1.1"], "comment": "2026-09-30: 保存済み公式資料で必須 value の正負、任意 ID、ID=-1 の全対象を確認。旧 default_value=1 と複数ターゲット時のフリーズを確認済みとするものではない。" } },
        { "path": ["notes"], "value": [{ "kind": "research", "legacy_index": 0, "content": "パラメーターでTargetリダイレクトを使用中に、複数ターゲットを保持するとフリーズする。対策方法は<a href=\"http://mugenbinran.web.fc2.com/error.html#02\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external\">こちら</a>・<a href=\"http://www49.atwiki.jp/mugencns/pages/263.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external\">こちら</a>。", "evidence": { "status": "unverified", "basis": ["community_documentation", "source_code"], "source_refs": ["targetfacing-freeze-binran", "targetfacing-freeze-wiki", "targetfacing-legacy-data"], "comment": "2026-09-30: 旧記録と参照を保持。対象ビルド、具体的なリダイレクト式、ターゲット数、実行ログは未確認。" } }] },
        { "path": ["quote", 5, "id"], "value": "targetfacing-freeze-wiki" },
        { "path": ["quote", 5, "source_type"], "value": "community_documentation" },
        { "path": ["quote", "-"], "value": { "id": "targetfacing-freeze-binran", "title": "Target リダイレクト中の複数ターゲット記録 — MUGENの便覧", "url": "http://mugenbinran.web.fc2.com/error.html#02", "source_type": "community_documentation" } },
        { "path": ["quote", "-"], "value": { "id": "targetfacing-local-2002", "title": "TargetFacing — 保存済み Elecbyte 2002.04.14 公式資料", "url": "/MUGEN/document/Official/2002.04.14/sctrls.html#TargetFacing", "source_type": "official_document" } },
        { "path": ["quote", "-"], "value": { "id": "targetfacing-local-1.0", "title": "TargetFacing — 保存済み Elecbyte 1.0 公式資料", "url": "/MUGEN/document/Official/1.0/sctrls.html#targetfacing", "source_type": "official_document" } },
        { "path": ["quote", "-"], "value": { "id": "targetfacing-local-1.1", "title": "TargetFacing — 保存済み Elecbyte 1.1 公式資料", "url": "/MUGEN/document/Official/1.1b1/sctrls.html#targetfacing", "source_type": "official_document" } },
